<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><p>Eldeco Terra And Sol is a New Launch project by Eldeco in Sector 80, Gurgaon, spread across 2.7 Acres with 224 homes. Eldeco Terra And Sol Sector 80 offers 3 BHK ranging from 2150 Sq.Ft. to 2450 Sq.Ft., priced from ₹ 3.23 Cr, with possession expected from Jan 2031. Positioned as a low-density, privacy-focused development along the NH-8 corridor, Eldeco Terra And Sol sits close to NH 8 in New Gurgaon. Eldeco brings decades of North Indian real estate experience to this launch, and Sector 80's average asking price runs close to Eldeco Terra And Sol's own rate, making it a fair benchmark against other Sector 80 new launches.</p></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

		
      
