              <div class="why-consider-list" id="why-consider-list">
              <ul><li>Experience iconic Japanese-inspired Onigiri architecture with timeless global appeal.</li><li>Immerse yourself in landscapes inspired by nature's five timeless elements.</li><li>Enjoy 100% corner residences designed for maximum light, ventilation, and privacy.</li><li>Expansive wraparound balconies capture panoramic views from every residence.</li><li>Enjoy unmatched convenience with IGI Airport just a short drive away.</li><li>Live minutes from Unitech Business Park and DLF Corporate Park, ensuring effortless work-life balance.</li><li>Close to  NH-48, ensuring effortless commuting and unmatched city connectivity.</li></ul>
