 <section class="white-box about-project" id="about-project" aria-labelledby="about-project-heading">
          <span class="section-label">Overview</span>
          <h2 class="section-title" id="about-project-heading">About Eldeco Terra And Sol, Sector 80 by Eldeco</h2>
          
<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><p>Eldeco Terra And Sol is a New Launch development in Sector 80, Gurgaon, built by Eldeco across 2.7 Acres. The project offers 224 homes in a single configuration, 3 BHK, with sizes running from 2150 Sq.Ft. to 2450 Sq.Ft.. Possession is scheduled from Jan 2031, and the project is registered under Haryana RERA number GGM/1048/780/2026/20.</p><h3>Key Project Details</h3><div><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Parameter</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Project Name</td><td>Eldeco Terra And Sol</td></tr><tr><td>Developer</td><td>Eldeco</td></tr><tr><td>Location</td><td>Sector 80, New Gurgaon, Gurgaon</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>New Launch</td></tr><tr><td>Possession</td><td>Jan 2031</td></tr><tr><td>RERA Number</td><td>GGM/1048/780/2026/20</td></tr><tr><td>Total Area</td><td>2.7 Acres</td></tr><tr><td>Total Units</td><td>224</td></tr><tr><td>Configuration</td><td>3 BHK</td></tr><tr><td>Size Range</td><td>2150 Sq.Ft. to 2450 Sq.Ft.</td></tr><tr><td>Starting Price</td><td>₹ 3.23 Cr</td></tr><tr><td>Connecting Roads</td><td>NH 8</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Eldeco Terra And Sol is a New Launch, low-density development spanning 2.7 Acres with 224 homes, priced from ₹ 3.23 Cr and registered under RERA number GGM/1048/780/2026/20.</p><h4>What makes Eldeco Terra And Sol different from other projects?</h4><ul><li>A genuinely low-density layout, just 224  units across 2.7 Acres acres, built around privacy and abundant natural light</li><li>A roughly 1.5-lakh-sq.-ft. clubhouse covering wellness, fitness, leisure, and entertainment</li><li>Direct access to NH-8, with the project's own materials citing a two-minute drive to the highway</li><li>Backed by Eldeco, a North Indian developer operating since 1975 with a long track record across Lucknow, Noida, Kanpur, and the wider NCR</li></ul></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

      </section>



      
