        <div class="recent-updates-box">
            <time class="recent-updates-date"> Last update: Aug 2026 </time>
          <ol class="updates-list">
            
            <li class="updates-list-item">
              <time class="updates-list-date"> Aug 2026 </time>
              
              <h4 class="updates-list-heading">Dwarka Expressway Emerges as Gurugram&#39;s Strongest Performing Residential Micromarket</h4>
              
              <p class="updates-list-description">In the first half of 2026, the Dwarka Expressway emerged as Gurugram&#39;s top-performing residential micromarket. Capital values of completed properties rose by 6% year-on-year, and rental values surged by 22% YoY. This strong performance is linked to improved connectivity and social infrastructure in the corridor.</p>
            </li>
            
            <li class="updates-list-item">
              <time class="updates-list-date"> Jul 2026 </time>
              
              <h4 class="updates-list-heading">GMDA Plans Expansion of Treated Water Supply Network Across Sectors 1-80</h4>
              
              <p class="updates-list-description">GMDA plans to expand the treated water pipeline network to cover sectors 1 to 80. This initiative aims to increase the supply of recycled water for non-potable uses like construction, industrial operations, and landscape maintenance, thereby reducing the reliance on freshwater resources.</p>
            </li>
            
            <li class="updates-list-item">
              <time class="updates-list-date"> Jul 2026 </time>
              
              <h4 class="updates-list-heading">DTCP Proposes Land Acquisition for Missing Sector Roads in Gurugram</h4>
              
              <p class="updates-list-description">The Department of Town and Country Planning (DTCP) has proposed acquiring approximately 1,150 acres to build 24-meter internal roads in Sectors 58 to 115 of Gurugram. This initiative aims to improve connectivity to private condominiums and residential colonies, addressing a long-standing issue for residents.</p>
            </li>
            
            <li class="updates-list-item">
              <time class="updates-list-date"> Jun 2026 </time>
              
              <p class="updates-list-description">During Q2&#39;2026, average property prices for Eldeco Terra And Sol moved from ₹ 11,200/sqft to ₹ 14,050/sqft, reflecting a 25.45% rise.</p>
            </li>
            
            <li class="updates-list-item">
              <time class="updates-list-date"> Apr 2026 </time>
              
              <h4 class="updates-list-heading">GMDA Re-invites Bids for Installation of 100 Emergency Call Points to Enhance Public Safety</h4>
              
              <p class="updates-list-description">GMDA has re-invited bids for the installation of 100 video-based Emergency Call Points (ECPs) across public locations in Gurgaon. This initiative aims to strengthen city policing and surveillance by allowing citizens to connect directly with the nearest police control room at the press of a button during emergencies. The project is estimated at Rs 7.4 crore,</p>
            </li>
            
          </ol>
        </div>
