  <section id="amenities" class="white-box amenities-specifications" aria-labelledby="amenities-specs-heading">
        <span class="section-label">Amenities</span>
          <h2 id="amenities-specs-heading" class="section-title">Amenities &amp; Specifications of Eldeco Terra And Sol</h2>
          
          
<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><p>Eldeco Terra And Sol's amenities are anchored by its roughly 1.5-lakh-sq.-ft. clubhouse, spread across sports, convenience, safety, leisure, and environment categories.</p><h3>Sports &amp; Fitness</h3><div><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Amenity</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gymnasium</td><td>Fitness</td></tr><tr><td>Swimming Pool</td><td>Aquatics</td></tr><tr><td>Badminton Court(s)</td><td>Racquet Sports</td></tr><tr><td>Yoga Areas</td><td>Wellness</td></tr><tr><td>Jogging / Cycle Track</td><td>Wellness</td></tr><tr><td>Table Tennis</td><td>Indoor Sport</td></tr><tr><td>Snooker / Pool / Billiards</td><td>Indoor Leisure</td></tr><tr><td>Kids' Play Areas / Sand Pits</td><td>Family</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Eldeco Terra And Sol's sports amenities cover eight distinct facilities, spanning fitness, aquatics, racquet sports, and indoor leisure, planned for daily use rather than occasional special-occasion access.</p><h3>Convenience &amp; Safety</h3><div><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Amenity</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Power Backup</td><td>Convenience</td></tr><tr><td>Treated Water Supply</td><td>Convenience</td></tr><tr><td>24x7 Water Supply</td><td>Convenience</td></tr><tr><td>Lift</td><td>Convenience</td></tr><tr><td>24x7 Security</td><td>Safety</td></tr><tr><td>CCTV / Video Surveillance</td><td>Safety</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Round-the-clock security and CCTV coverage sit alongside treated and 24x7 water supply, covering the daily essentials across the project's 224 homes.</p><h3>Leisure &amp; Environment</h3><div><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Amenity</strong></th><th><strong>Category</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Clubhouse</td><td>Leisure</td></tr><tr><td>Indoor Games</td><td>Leisure</td></tr><tr><td>Normal Park / Central Green</td><td>Environment</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>The clubhouse and central green anchor Eldeco Terra And Sol's leisure and environment offering, in keeping with the project's stated low-density, landscaped-open-space positioning rather than a dense amenity checklist.</p></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

          
          
