 <section class="white-box bx-no-space location-intelligence" id="location-intelligence" aria-labelledby="location-intelligence-heading">
        <span class="section-label">Location</span>
        <h2 id="location-intelligence-heading" class="section-title"> Location and Connectivity Around Eldeco Sector 80 </h2>
        
        
<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><p>Eldeco Terra And Sol sits in Sector 80, part of New Gurgaon, directly connected via NH 8. Sector 80's average asking price runs close to Eldeco Terra And Sol's own rate, making it a fair, like-for-like comparison for anyone shortlisting Sector 80 new launches.</p><h3>Connectivity</h3><div><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Landmark</strong></th><th><strong>Distance</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>NH 8</td><td>1.5 km</td></tr><tr><td>Cyber City</td><td>Short drive via NH 8</td></tr><tr><td>Manesar Industrial Area</td><td>Short drive via NH 8</td></tr><tr><td>Udyog Vihar</td><td>Short drive via NH 8</td></tr><tr><td>IGI Airport</td><td>30 to 40 minutes</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>NH 8 sits about 1.5 km from Eldeco Terra And Sol, and IGI Airport is roughly a 30-40 minute drive, giving the project reasonably direct access to both regional highway traffic and air travel.</p><h3>Nearby Places (Confirmed Distances)</h3><div><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Place</strong></th><th><strong>Distance</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Ompee Global School</td><td>0.41 km</td></tr><tr><td>Prachin Mandir</td><td>0.39 km</td></tr><tr><td>HDFC Bank</td><td>0.63 km</td></tr><tr><td>Savoy Suites (Hotel)</td><td>0.82 km</td></tr><tr><td>Prakash Hospital</td><td>1.67 km</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>The closest confirmed landmarks to Eldeco Terra And Sol, a school, a temple, and a bank, all sit within roughly 0.65 km, while the nearest hospital is a still-reasonable 1.67 km away.</p><p>Beyond these, the wider catchment includes Bal Bharati Public School and Medeor Hospital for education and healthcare, Eros Corporate Park and Cyberwalk for office space, and Hyatt Regency Gurgaon and Vatika Town Square-INXT for hospitality and retail, all within the broader Sector 80 and IMT Manesar corridor.</p><h3>Is this a practical daily address?</h3><p>Reasonably so. A school, temple, and bank all sit within walking-to-short-drive distance, and NH-8 access is close enough to support the project's own "two minutes from NH-48" claim for highway-adjacent commuting, even though the dedicated Connecting Roads data lists a slightly more conservative 1.5 km. Cyber City, Manesar Industrial Area, and Udyog Vihar are all reachable within a short drive, and the roughly 30-40 minute IGI Airport run is workable for frequent travellers, though not a short hop.</p></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

        
