 <section class="white-box rera-details-section" aria-labelledby="rera-details-heading" id="rera-details">
            <span class="section-label">RERA</span>
            <h2 id="rera-details-heading" class="section-title">
                RERA Details of Eldeco Terra And Sol 
            </h2>
    
        
<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><p>Eldeco Terra And Sol is registered under Haryana RERA number GGM/1048/780/2026/20, with a declared possession date of Jan 2031. The registered developer entity is Eldeco.</p><h3>RERA Parameters</h3><div><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Parameter</strong></th><th><strong>Details</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>RERA Number</td><td>GGM/1048/780/2026/20</td></tr><tr><td>Regulatory Authority</td><td>Haryana RERA (H-RERA)</td></tr><tr><td>Registered Developer</td><td>Eldeco</td></tr><tr><td>Declared Possession</td><td>Jan 2031</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>New Launch</td></tr><tr><td>Total Units</td><td>224</td></tr><tr><td>Site Area</td><td>2.7 Acres</td></tr><tr><td>Verification Portal</td><td>haryanarera.gov.in</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Eldeco Terra And Sol's RERA registration, GGM/1048/780/2026/20, is stated consistently across the project's About, RERA Details, and FAQ sections, and is verifiable directly on haryanarera.gov.in.</p><h3>Key buyer protections</h3><ul><li>RERA registration places Eldeco Terra And Sol's layout, specifications, and delivery commitments on public record, preventing arbitrary changes</li><li>Buyers get a formal grievance mechanism in case of delays or deviations from promised features</li><li>The registered developer, Eldeco, remains legally accountable for delivery against the disclosed plans and January 2031 possession timeline</li></ul><h3>Stamp Duty in Gurgaon (Gurgaon, Haryana):</h3><p><strong></strong></p><div><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Ownership Type</strong></th><th><strong>Stamp Duty</strong></th><th><strong>Registration Charges</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Male Ownership</td><td>7%</td><td>1% of total value</td></tr><tr><td>Female Ownership</td><td>5%</td><td>1% of total value</td></tr><tr><td>Joint Ownership</td><td>6%</td><td>1% of total value</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Stamp duty in Gurgaon, Haryana ranges from 5% for female ownership to 7% for male ownership, with joint ownership at 6%, plus a 1% registration charge across all categories.</p></div>
