  <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#organization","name":"Square Yards","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#logo","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/assets/images/squareyards-logo-new.png","contentUrl":"https://www.squareyards.com/assets/images/squareyards-logo-new.png","caption":"Square Yards"},"image":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#logo"},"address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"M3M Urbana Business Park, 1st Floor, Tower A, Sector 67","addressLocality":"Gurgaon","addressRegion":"Haryana","postalCode":"122102","addressCountry":"IN"},"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","email":"connect@squareyards.com","availableLanguage":"en"}],"sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/SquareYards","https://www.linkedin.com/company/square-yards","https://www.youtube.com/@Square_Yards","https://www.instagram.com/square_yards/"]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#website","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/","name":"Square Yards","publisher":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#organization"},"inLanguage":"en-IN"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/eldeco-projects/38/builder#organization","name":"Eldeco","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/eldeco-projects/38/builder","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/eldeco-38-9577.jpg","contentUrl":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/eldeco-38-9577.jpg","caption":"Eldeco developer logo"},"description":"The Eldeco Group is a reputed real estate development organization that has established itself as a prominent player in the North Indian real estate market since its inception in 1975. Over the years, the group has built a strong presence in various regional cities, including Lucknow, Noida, Kanpur, Greater Noida, and other NCR cities.\r\nWith its impeccable reputation and extensive experience, the group has become a go-to choice for homebuyers and investors looking for quality and reliable real estate solutions. The Eldeco Group has a diversified portfolio of over 175 projects, which includes a wide range of properties such as high-rise condominiums, townships, shopping malls, industrial estates, and office complexes.\r\nWith 30 ongoing projects and more than 30 million sq. ft. of successful deliveries, the group has established itself as a trusted name in the real estate industry, delivering projects that meet high standards of quality and excellence.\r\nThe Eldeco Group operates through two major companies: Eldeco Housing and Industries Limited and Eldeco Infrastructure and Properties Limited. These companies cater to various income groups and market segments, offering customers a wide range of real estate solutions. As listed on Square Yards, Eldeco has 90 total projects, of which 71 are delivered."},{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/eldeco-terra-and-sol-sector-80-gurgaon-npd-344020#primaryimage","url":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/gurgaon/project-image/eldeco-terra-and-sol-project-project-large-image1-3046-opt-310cf38d-d7d7-499f-b7f3-2518578defbf.jpg","contentUrl":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/gurgaon/project-image/eldeco-terra-and-sol-project-project-large-image1-3046-opt-310cf38d-d7d7-499f-b7f3-2518578defbf.jpg","caption":"Cover image of Eldeco Terra And Sol, Sector 80, Gurgaon"},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/eldeco-terra-and-sol-sector-80-gurgaon-npd-344020#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.squareyards.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"New Projects in Gurgaon","item":"https://www.squareyards.com/new-projects-in-gurgaon"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Projects in Sector 80","item":"https://www.squareyards.com/pr